---@field DomainSigningPrivateKey? aws.sesv2.PrivateKey|distilled.Secret [Bring Your Own DKIM] A private key that's used to generate a DKIM signature.
---@field NextSigningKeyLength? aws.sesv2.DkimSigningKeyLength|string [Easy DKIM] The key length of the future DKIM key pair to be generated. This can be changed at most once per day.
