---An object that contains the deliverability data for a specific campaign. This data is available for a campaign only if the campaign sent email by using a domain that the Deliverability dashboard is enabled for (PutDeliverabilityDashboardOption operation).
---@class aws.sesv2.DomainDeliverabilityCampaign
---@field CampaignId? aws.sesv2.CampaignId The unique identifier for the campaign. The Deliverability dashboard automatically generates and assigns this identifier to a campaign.
---@field ImageUrl? aws.sesv2.ImageUrl The URL of an image that contains a snapshot of the email message that was sent.
---@field Subject? aws.sesv2.Subject The subject line, or title, of the email message.
---@field FromAddress? aws.sesv2.Identity The verified email address that the email message was sent from.
---@field SendingIps? aws.sesv2.IpList The IP addresses that were used to send the email message.
---@field FirstSeenDateTime? aws.sesv2.Timestamp The first time when the email message was delivered to any recipient's inbox. This value can help you determine how long it took for a campaign to deliver an email message.
---@field LastSeenDateTime? aws.sesv2.Timestamp The last time when the email message was delivered to any recipient's inbox. This value can help you determine how long it took for a campaign to deliver an email message.
---@field InboxCount? aws.sesv2.Volume The number of email messages that were delivered to recipients’ inboxes.
---@field SpamCount? aws.sesv2.Volume The number of email messages that were delivered to recipients' spam or junk mail folders.
---@field ReadRate? aws.sesv2.Percentage The percentage of email messages that were opened by recipients. Due to technical limitations, this value only includes recipients who opened the message by using an email client that supports images.
---@field DeleteRate? aws.sesv2.Percentage The percentage of email messages that were deleted by recipients, without being opened first. Due to technical limitations, this value only includes recipients who opened the message by using an email client that supports images.
---@field ReadDeleteRate? aws.sesv2.Percentage The percentage of email messages that were opened and then deleted by recipients. Due to technical limitations, this value only includes recipients who opened the message by using an email client that supports images.
---@field ProjectedVolume? aws.sesv2.Volume The projected number of recipients that the email message was sent to.
---@field Esps? aws.sesv2.Esps The major email providers who handled the email message.

---@alias aws.sesv2.DomainDeliverabilityCampaignList aws.sesv2.DomainDeliverabilityCampaign[]

